sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Agent / Dispatcher
    participant RAG as RAG Service Engine
    participant Hybrid as Hybrid Retriever (Vector + BM25)
    participant CrossEnc as Cross-Encoder Reranker
    participant Verifier as Self-RAG Verifier Node
    participant LLM as LLM Provider

    User->>RAG: Query: "Maximum spray boom height and wind limits for organic boundary"
    RAG->>Hybrid: Retrieve top 8 dense chunks & top 8 sparse BM25 chunks
    Hybrid-->>RAG: 16 candidate chunks
    RAG->>CrossEnc: Rerank candidates by semantic cross-attention
    CrossEnc-->>RAG: Top 3 highest-scoring chunks
    RAG->>Verifier: Check relevance and factual support against query
    Verifier->>LLM: Verify grounding prompt
    LLM-->>Verifier: Grounded = True (Confidence = 0.98)
    Verifier-->>RAG: Verified knowledge with source citations (SOP-CHEM-4040, MAN-001)
    RAG-->>User: Structured Knowledge Deliverable with highlighted regulatory constraints
